{"data":{"listItems":[{"id":"920effc9-8f98-4489-a080-df39ddf82bd4","slug":"does-ai-actually-know-what-people-want","title":"Does AI actually know what people want?","description":"As AI makes it easier to build almost anything, how do we ensure we’re building the right things? As the barriers to creation fall, understanding human needs becomes more valuable than ever.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:10:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T11:30:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"5635927d-b7a7-4537-9720-6746e34bbab8","name":"Stage 3","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"f473c8ef-86d5-43c5-b348-f4e5520b63af","name":"Emily Goligoski","company_name":"Columbia University","job_title":"Researcher & Adjunct Professor","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/jcqirn2bmwv9romjp1w55atxp539?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/jcqirn2bmwv9romjp1w55atxp539?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/jcqirn2bmwv9romjp1w55atxp539?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/jcqirn2bmwv9romjp1w55atxp539?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/jcqirn2bmwv9romjp1w55atxp539?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}},{"id":"","attendance_id":"81f594c4-bc44-498d-bc0e-6988e9cefd7c","name":"Angie Amlani","company_name":"Metalab","job_title":"Head of Research & Strategy","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/k8uualpl5e9ncbkio3zi32vdq6wz?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/k8uualpl5e9ncbkio3zi32vdq6wz?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/k8uualpl5e9ncbkio3zi32vdq6wz?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/k8uualpl5e9ncbkio3zi32vdq6wz?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/k8uualpl5e9ncbkio3zi32vdq6wz?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Creative Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"913b8fc9-7e6c-4a2f-96a4-df52b6bd2942","slug":"the-attackers-are-open-source-the-defences-aren-t","title":"The attackers are open source. The defences aren't.","description":"Online abuse operates like an open-source community where bad actors freely trade playbooks, while safety tools remain locked within deep-pocketed tech giants. But protecting the most vulnerable online shouldn’t depend on a platform’s profit margin or proprietary tech. Anne Bertucio de Hollembeak, COO of ROOST joins us for an honest discussion on the realities of digital harm and what it takes to build accessible defences that level the playing field.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:10:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T11:30:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"0bfb2e82-760f-45dc-b560-0d0fbc4bd293","name":"Stage 8","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"3a9f8e0b-7ec5-4dc9-b5ec-5729164cf22f","name":"Anne Bertucio de Hollembeak","company_name":"Robust Open Online Safety Tools","job_title":"Chief Operating Officer","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/33yv30o0hd6c2hksxwjqbtfu240t?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/33yv30o0hd6c2hksxwjqbtfu240t?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/33yv30o0hd6c2hksxwjqbtfu240t?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/33yv30o0hd6c2hksxwjqbtfu240t?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/33yv30o0hd6c2hksxwjqbtfu240t?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Cybersecurity Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"7c7f4d31-cd59-4360-87c1-97086cf1a64f","slug":"world-models-for-the-physical-world","title":"World models for the physical world","description":"As AI moves beyond language and digital environments, the next frontier is understanding and interacting with the physical world. In this keynote, Cristian Bodnar, founding member of Prometheus, will explore how world models can enable machines to reason about physical environments, predict how they evolve, and make better decisions under uncertainty.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:15:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T11:35:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"90a7d849-c0d0-473d-becf-b9cab8096e3d","name":"Stage 13","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"154c5964-70dc-4910-9f1e-b649b7152b17","name":"Cristian Bodnar","company_name":"Prometheus","job_title":"Founding member","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/snd0f9hi2ltrnvfv39z8ehfxhnvi?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/snd0f9hi2ltrnvfv39z8ehfxhnvi?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/snd0f9hi2ltrnvfv39z8ehfxhnvi?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/snd0f9hi2ltrnvfv39z8ehfxhnvi?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/snd0f9hi2ltrnvfv39z8ehfxhnvi?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"AI Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"74ceac99-f062-4bbf-9fc2-839c8ade7049","slug":"beyond-unhinged-duolingo-s-next-chapter","title":"Beyond unhinged: Duolingo’s next chapter","description":"Duolingo became one of the world's most recognizable brands by mastering social media and embracing internet culture. But today’s marketing landscape is changing, as audiences fragment across platforms, creators, and communities. Join CMO Manu Orssaud as he explores their next phase of growth and discusses how companies can evolve from grabbing attention to building a brand people keep coming back to.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:15:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T11:40:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"716e89fb-86fe-4af9-a8c8-05a779333998","name":"Stage 14","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"5e76f611-4658-409e-baac-5d2dedefbaf2","name":"Manu Orssaud","company_name":"Duolingo","job_title":"CMO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/8q2jsvh6ylmsbs4aw8dyfapeyc94?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/8q2jsvh6ylmsbs4aw8dyfapeyc94?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/8q2jsvh6ylmsbs4aw8dyfapeyc94?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/8q2jsvh6ylmsbs4aw8dyfapeyc94?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/8q2jsvh6ylmsbs4aw8dyfapeyc94?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Marketing Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"bb54e6d8-8439-47ec-b750-4aa607af6470","slug":"customers-hold-the-secret-sauce-and-ai-can-t-cook-without-it","title":"Customers hold the secret sauce, and AI can't cook without it","description":"As AI radically lowers the barrier to creation, raw technical capability is no longer a differentiator among companies. True success hinges specifically on understanding customer taste and treating it as the secret sauce of business. In a world of infinite potential products, the rarest skill becomes knowing which problems matter, what to build, and why people will choose it. Ultimately, the winners of this era won't be the companies with the most AI, but those that stay closest to the humans they are building for.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:20:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T11:30:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"a871cf88-732c-432d-8969-1226f4fc575b","name":"Stage 9","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"ca5d7599-037c-49ed-9c12-d33a4f48f689","name":"Anne Scherer","company_name":"Delta Labs","job_title":"Co-Founder","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/tvm5fnwu85g988wjb6j1lbkc4eoj?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/tvm5fnwu85g988wjb6j1lbkc4eoj?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/tvm5fnwu85g988wjb6j1lbkc4eoj?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/tvm5fnwu85g988wjb6j1lbkc4eoj?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/tvm5fnwu85g988wjb6j1lbkc4eoj?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Growth Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"a341d762-6777-42f1-8fe9-33b39efa6e6c","slug":"the-women-s-health-data-gap","title":"The Women’s health data gap","description":"Just like tech systems glitch without enough data, women’s health suffers from decades of missing research and forgotten data. Beyond the current funding hype, how do we actually bridge this gap? Discover how AI uses data and inference to solve healthcare's \"cold start\" problem, turning missing data into real answers while keeping privacy and accuracy front and centre.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:20:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T11:40:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"ca314426-f597-44d0-b3cd-f3017a2bbcb4","name":"Stage 5","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"0b18e31d-bb0b-435e-9f12-2e575bd5c23b","name":"Rhiannon White","company_name":"Clue","job_title":"CEO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/5n9197gw09lp2z6o6kgie3us4oai?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/5n9197gw09lp2z6o6kgie3us4oai?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/5n9197gw09lp2z6o6kgie3us4oai?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/5n9197gw09lp2z6o6kgie3us4oai?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/5n9197gw09lp2z6o6kgie3us4oai?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}},{"id":"","attendance_id":"60bb5194-aefd-4bd0-a71b-5c682d106b69","name":"Katherine Ward","company_name":"Global News","job_title":"Network Health Reporter","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/pd2m3j0oz2tuic6lrv5w0aic7j9h?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/pd2m3j0oz2tuic6lrv5w0aic7j9h?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/pd2m3j0oz2tuic6lrv5w0aic7j9h?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/pd2m3j0oz2tuic6lrv5w0aic7j9h?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/pd2m3j0oz2tuic6lrv5w0aic7j9h?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Health Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"9cc4d0c2-3103-4876-8ed7-146d7bd1b090","slug":"running-quantum-accurate-physics-on-standard-gpus","title":"Running quantum-accurate physics on standard GPUs","description":"You don’t need a cryogenic quantum computer in your basement to solve quantum-level computational problems today. Stefan Leichenauer explains how SandboxAQ bridges quantum physics and high-performance classical hardware using cloud infrastructure and GPU acceleration. Find out how scientists and software developers are using massive, highly parallel physics simulations and quantitative AI for drug discovery and materials science.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T11:20:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T11:40:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"685b779a-20e7-4280-b402-b239764fb6d6","name":"Stage 10","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"26102ec2-f08f-40dc-b1ea-05ced9e1cde8","name":"Stefan Leichenauer","company_name":"SandboxAQ","job_title":"CTO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/4kuo5n120hkbfp93hn2dzec1fmrf?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/4kuo5n120hkbfp93hn2dzec1fmrf?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/4kuo5n120hkbfp93hn2dzec1fmrf?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/4kuo5n120hkbfp93hn2dzec1fmrf?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/4kuo5n120hkbfp93hn2dzec1fmrf?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}},{"id":"","attendance_id":"d97f2a0f-78bd-44e3-89d2-10ca7d96a49f","name":"Mike Butcher","company_name":"Pathfounders","job_title":"Founder","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":null,"thumb":null,"medium":null,"large":null,"original":null}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Developer Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null}],"page":6,"nbPages":28,"maximumPages":32}}